    "replacement_source": "def build_algorithm_kwargs(config):\n    kwargs = dict(config)\n    kwargs[\"num_learning_epochs\"] = kwargs[\"num_learning_epochs\"]\n    return kwargs",
    "evidence_ids": [
      "configured.epochs",
      "configured.minibatches",
      "inspection.expected_steps",
      "inspection.actual_steps",
      "inspection.actual_minibatches"
    ],
    "rationale": "The adapter omits num_learning_epochs from the algorithm kwargs, so the PPO update performs only one epoch per step instead of the configured 4 epochs. The measured actual steps [3, 3, 3] total 9 rather than the expected 12 steps for 4 epochs over 3 minibatches. The patch preserves all configured parameters by copying the full config and explicitly assigning num_learning_epochs from the local dictionary, without hardcoding epoch or minibatch counts."
  },
